            "block_content": "h. Spinal and extremity manipulations by an approved provider, such as a doctor of medicine (M.D.), a doctor of osteopathy (D.O.), or a chiropractic doctor (D.C.), for up to twenty-six (26) spinal and extremity manipulations performed by hand each year. Related services, such as an initial examination and initial X-rays, also are covered.",
